WEBVTT

00:10.680 --> 00:11.611
[tires squealing]
[轮胎吱吱声]

00:11.680 --> 00:12.749
[engine revs]
[发动机转速]

00:12.818 --> 00:14.163
Now, SpongeBob,
现在，海绵宝宝，

00:14.232 --> 00:17.370
what is the proper procedure
for making a right turn?
正确的程序是什么
为了右转？

00:17.439 --> 00:18.370
Hmm...
唔...

00:18.439 --> 00:19.439
Ooh!
哦！

00:19.473 --> 00:20.518
Hold on,
I'll check the textbook.
坚持住，
我去查一下课本。

00:20.542 --> 00:21.853
[shouts]
[喊叫]

00:21.922 --> 00:23.853
Ah, your mirror and you.
啊，你的镜子和你。

00:23.922 --> 00:24.922
No.
不。

00:24.991 --> 00:26.035
Oh, proper seatbelt hygiene?
哦，正确的安全带卫生？

00:26.059 --> 00:27.059
No.
不。

00:27.094 --> 00:29.646
Assuming crash position.
假设碰撞位置。

00:30.335 --> 00:32.439
[screaming]
[尖叫]

00:32.508 --> 00:34.301
Whoa, whoa, whoa!
哇哇哇！

00:34.370 --> 00:36.680
[screaming]
[尖叫]

00:36.749 --> 00:38.163
<i>[surf rock music]</i>
<i>[冲浪摇滚音乐]</i>

00:38.232 --> 00:40.059
[screaming and tires squealing]
[尖叫声和轮胎尖叫声]

00:40.128 --> 00:41.301
[yowls]
[嚎叫]

00:41.370 --> 00:42.749
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

00:42.818 --> 00:45.715
[brakes screeching]
[刹车声]

00:47.059 --> 00:49.680
[gasps]
We didn't crash!
[喘气]
我们没有坠毁！

00:49.749 --> 00:51.025
Hooray!
万岁！

00:51.094 --> 00:53.508
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

00:53.577 --> 00:54.715
both: Huh?
两人：啊？

00:54.784 --> 00:56.094
[crashing and banging]
[碰撞和撞击]

00:56.163 --> 00:57.094
[bones shaking]
[骨头颤抖]

00:57.163 --> 00:59.266
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

01:03.853 --> 01:06.025
Mrs. Puff?
泡芙夫人？

01:06.094 --> 01:07.508
Oh, there you are!
哦，你在那里！

01:07.577 --> 01:08.577
[grunts]
[咕哝]

01:08.646 --> 01:09.646
Oh!
哦！

01:09.680 --> 01:11.059
[strains]
[菌株]

01:11.128 --> 01:12.232
[giggles nervously]
[紧张地咯咯笑]

01:12.301 --> 01:13.484
I'll make it up to you,
Mrs. Puff!
我会补偿你的
泡芙太太！

01:13.508 --> 01:14.784
- Oh!
- Shine your shoes?
- 哦！
- 擦鞋吗？

01:14.853 --> 01:16.508
[tongue squeaks]
[舌头吱吱作响]

01:17.370 --> 01:18.301
Style your hair?
设计你的头发？

01:18.370 --> 01:21.473
[hair dryer whirs]
[吹风机呼呼地响]

01:22.611 --> 01:23.611
Ow!
噢！

01:23.646 --> 01:24.818
[groans angrily]
[愤怒地呻吟]

01:24.887 --> 01:27.542
Oil your boat?
给你的船加油吗？

01:27.611 --> 01:28.542
Oh, ah!
哦，啊！

01:28.611 --> 01:29.404
[gasps]
[喘气]

01:29.473 --> 01:31.059
Spongebob... [stammers]
海绵宝宝……[结巴]

01:31.128 --> 01:32.715
stop!
停止！

01:32.784 --> 01:33.784
Cease!
停止！

01:33.818 --> 01:38.163
And desist!
并停止！

01:38.232 --> 01:41.059
[breathes heavily]
[呼吸粗重]

01:41.128 --> 01:42.370
[groans]
[呻吟]

01:43.818 --> 01:47.232
Well, you could
clean up all this junk.
嗯，你可以
清理所有这些垃圾。

01:47.301 --> 01:51.680
I've been tossing stuff in this
old lighthouse for 20 years.
我一直在里面扔东西
老灯塔已经有20年历史了。

01:51.749 --> 01:52.818
Ooh!
哦！

01:52.887 --> 01:54.956
I love cleaning!
我爱清洁！

01:55.025 --> 01:56.577
Uh-huh.
嗯嗯。

01:56.646 --> 01:58.163
Glad to hear it.
很高兴听到这个消息。

01:58.232 --> 02:00.094
I'll be in my classroom.
我会在我的教室里。

02:00.163 --> 02:02.577
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

02:02.646 --> 02:03.473
Oh!
哦！

02:03.542 --> 02:06.232
And if you need me...
如果你需要我...

02:06.301 --> 02:07.439
don't.
不。

02:09.473 --> 02:12.439
[inhales deeply]
[深吸一口气]

02:12.508 --> 02:15.232
[meditative music plays]
[冥想音乐响起]

02:15.301 --> 02:16.232
[heavy metal music plays]
[重金属音乐响起]

02:16.301 --> 02:17.715
♪ Talk to the fin! ♪
♪ 与鳍交谈！ ♪

02:17.784 --> 02:19.266
♪ Don't care
where you've been! ♪
♪ 不在乎
你去过哪里！ ♪

02:19.335 --> 02:22.094
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪
♪ ♪

02:22.163 --> 02:25.094
<i>[upbeat ukulele music]</i>
<i>[欢快的尤克里里音乐]</i>

02:25.163 --> 02:26.163
[shouts excitedly]
[兴奋地喊道]

02:26.232 --> 02:27.887
[grunts and strains]
[咕哝声和压力]

02:27.956 --> 02:29.956
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

02:30.025 --> 02:31.439
