[击鼓声]

02:34.818 --> 02:35.749
[strains]
[菌株]

02:35.818 --> 02:41.784
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

02:41.853 --> 02:44.197
