[gobbles]
[狼吞虎咽]

02:54.439 --> 02:57.301
[slurping]
[发出声音]

02:57.370 --> 03:01.059
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

03:01.128 --> 03:02.853
[burps]
[打嗝]

03:02.922 --> 03:04.301
[knuckles crack]
[指关节断裂]

03:04.370 --> 03:07.301
[grunts theatrically]
[戏剧性地咕哝]

03:07.370 --> 03:12.370
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

03:12.439 --> 03:15.335
[jabbers excitedly]
[兴奋地叽叽喳喳]

03:15.404 --> 03:17.232
Ah, that takes care of that.
啊，这就解决了。

03:17.301 --> 03:18.473
Huh?
Hmm.
啊？
唔。

03:18.542 --> 03:19.853
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

03:19.922 --> 03:21.473
[coughs]
[咳嗽]

03:21.542 --> 03:24.266
Yuck, this place
needs a good scrub.
恶心，这个地方
需要好好擦洗。

03:24.335 --> 03:29.853
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

03:29.922 --> 03:31.301
[slurps]
[啜饮]

03:31.370 --> 03:38.266
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

03:38.335 --> 03:41.025
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

03:41.094 --> 03:42.025
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

03:42.094 --> 03:44.370
Oh, whoa, whoa!
哦，哇哦！

03:44.439 --> 03:46.197
Whoa!
哇！

03:46.266 --> 03:47.853
Ah!
Almost done.
啊!
快完成了。

03:47.922 --> 03:50.335
I just need to shine up
the old lighthouse's lantern.
我只需要闪耀
老灯塔的灯笼。

03:50.404 --> 03:52.059
[eerie howl]
[怪异的嚎叫]

03:52.128 --> 03:53.128
[gasps]
[喘气]

03:53.197 --> 03:54.611
The lighthouse is haunted!
灯塔闹鬼了！

03:54.680 --> 03:55.991
Just like my toaster.
就像我的烤面包机一样。

03:56.059 --> 03:58.853
[ghostly howls]
[幽灵般的嚎叫]

03:58.922 --> 04:01.784
[wails loudly]
[大声哀嚎]

04:01.853 --> 04:03.956
Um...
嗯...

04:04.025 --> 04:05.025
[door squeaks]
[门吱吱作响]

04:05.059 --> 04:06.232
<i>[horror movie music]</i>
<i>[恐怖电影音乐]</i>

04:06.301 --> 04:07.301
Whoa!
哇！

04:07.335 --> 04:08.508
That box is haunted!
那个盒子闹鬼了！

04:08.577 --> 04:10.335
[grunts and groans]
[咕哝和呻吟]

04:10.404 --> 04:12.439
These stairs are haunted!
这些楼梯闹鬼！

04:12.508 --> 04:13.404
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

04:13.473 --> 04:14.956
[shouts]
[喊叫]

04:15.025 --> 04:16.577
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

04:16.646 --> 04:18.335
This trash is haunted.
这个垃圾是闹鬼的。

04:18.404 --> 04:20.887
[growls]
[咆哮]

04:20.956 --> 04:21.887
[screams]
[尖叫声]

04:21.956 --> 04:24.715
[growls]
[咆哮]

04:24.784 --> 04:26.197
