<i>[激烈的戏剧音乐]</i>

04:26.266 --> 04:27.577
[meows]
[喵喵]

04:27.991 --> 04:28.922
[screams]
[尖叫声]

04:28.991 --> 04:30.370
Ghost snail!
幽灵蜗牛！

04:30.439 --> 04:31.646
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

04:31.715 --> 04:32.991
- [meows]
- Hmm?
- [喵]
- 嗯？

04:33.059 --> 04:34.232
Oh!
[giggles]
哦！
[咯咯笑]

04:34.301 --> 04:35.542
You're no ghost!
你不是鬼！

04:35.611 --> 04:37.715
Just a cute little stray snail!
简直就是一只可爱的小蜗牛啊！

04:37.784 --> 04:39.232
How about I call you Louie?
我叫你路易怎么样？

04:39.301 --> 04:40.380
- [purrs]
- Lighthouse Louie!
- [呼噜声]
- 灯塔路易！

04:40.404 --> 04:41.335
[giggles]
[咯咯笑]

04:41.404 --> 04:42.611
Meow, meow!
喵喵！

04:42.680 --> 04:43.991
<i>[upbeat ukulele music]</i>
<i>[欢快的尤克里里音乐]</i>

04:44.059 --> 04:46.749
Now Louie, you be good
while Uncle SpongeBob cleans.
路易，你要乖一点
当海绵宝宝叔叔打扫卫生时。

04:46.818 --> 04:48.749
[strains]
[菌株]

04:48.818 --> 04:50.439
[meows]
[喵喵]

04:50.508 --> 04:51.404
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

04:51.473 --> 04:52.887
Oy, oy!
哎哟，哎哟！

04:52.956 --> 04:53.956
Oh.
哦。

04:53.991 --> 04:56.715
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

04:56.784 --> 04:58.439
[meows]
[喵喵]

04:58.508 --> 05:01.439
Louie, I'm afraid you'll have
to play out here, little fella,
路易，恐怕你会
来这里玩，小家伙，

05:01.508 --> 05:02.922
for your own safety.
为了您自己的安全。

05:02.991 --> 05:03.887
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

05:03.956 --> 05:04.956
Phew!
唷！

05:05.025 --> 05:05.818
[hair dryer whirs]
[吹风机呼呼地响]

05:05.887 --> 05:06.922
[coach's whistle blows]
[教练哨声响起]

05:06.991 --> 05:07.991
[telephone rings]
[电话铃声]

05:08.542 --> 05:10.266
[meows]
[喵喵]

05:10.335 --> 05:12.404
- - What?
- Louie?
- - 什么？
- 路易？

05:12.473 --> 05:14.370
<i>[upbeat Hawaiian music]</i>
<i>[欢快的夏威夷音乐]</i>

05:14.439 --> 05:16.025
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

05:16.094 --> 05:17.380
Well, that oughta keep you
out of my
好吧，那应该让你
从我的

05:17.404 --> 05:18.473
hair?
头发？

05:18.542 --> 05:19.646
[meows]
[喵喵]

05:19.715 --> 05:20.715
Sorry, Louie.
对不起，路易。

05:20.749 --> 05:22.370
You have to stay outside.
你必须呆在外面。

05:22.439 --> 05:23.301
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

05:23.370 --> 05:24.404
Ow!
噢！

05:24.473 --> 05:25.577
[metallic clang]
[金属铿锵声]

05:25.646 --> 05:26.956
No silly little snail
没有愚蠢的小蜗牛

05:27.025 --> 05:30.439
is a match for
my superior sponge brain!
是一个匹配项
我优越的海绵大脑！

05:31.163 --> 05:33.128
[wails]
[哀号]

05:33.197 --> 05:34.128
[plops]
[扑通扑通]

05:34.197 --> 05:35.542
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

05:35.611 --> 05:37.508
[giggles quietly]
[轻声笑]

05:37.577 --> 05:40.542
[can opener whirs]
[开罐器呼呼地响]

05:40.611 --> 05:42.818
<i>[suspenseful music]</i>
<i>[悬疑音乐]</i>

05:42.887 --> 05:45.715
And the bait, one can o' patty!
还有诱饵，一罐肉饼！

05:45.784 --> 05:48.266
[chuckles confidently]
[自信地笑]

05:48.335 --> 05:49.232
[meows excitedly]
[兴奋喵]

05:49.301 --> 05:50.232
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

05:50.301 --> 05:52.749
[slurping]
[发出声音]

05:53.853 --> 05:54.784
Gotcha!
明白了！

05:54.853 --> 05:55.853
[meows]
[喵喵]

05:56.749 --> 05:57.956
I don't gotcha?
我不明白吗？

06:01.232 --> 06:02.646
You got <i>me.</i>
你有我。</i>

06:04.508 --> 06:07.646
[straining]
[紧张]

06:09.404 --> 06:10.646
[blabbers]
[喋喋不休]

06:11.508 --> 06:12.887
Barnacles, that's heavy!
藤壶，好重啊！

06:12.956 --> 06:13.991
Huh?
啊？

06:14.059 --> 06:15.266
Ah!
啊!

06:15.646 --> 06:18.128
<i>[suspenseful ukulele music]</i>
<i>[悬疑的尤克里里音乐]</i>

06:18.197 --> 06:19.197
[gulps]
[吞咽]

06:19.232 --> 06:20.232
<i>[bell rings]</i>
<i>[铃声响起]</i>

06:20.266 --> 06:23.163
<i>[old-timey sailor music]</i>
<i>[老式水手音乐]</i>

06:23.232 --> 06:24.853
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

06:24.922 --> 06:26.059
