<i>[气球吱吱声]</i>

06:31.094 --> 06:33.887
Louie, Louie!
路易，路易！

06:33.956 --> 06:35.163
Louie!
路易！

06:35.232 --> 06:36.128
[meows]
[喵喵]

06:36.197 --> 06:37.266
Louie!
路易！

06:37.335 --> 06:38.749
So this is where
