06:39.128 --> 06:40.266
[snarls ferociously]
[凶猛地咆哮]

06:40.335 --> 06:41.335
[gulps]
[吞咽]

06:41.404 --> 06:43.094
Nice snail.
Good Louie!
好蜗牛。
好路易！

06:43.163 --> 06:44.887
No, no, no!
不，不，不！

06:44.956 --> 06:46.232
[screams]
[尖叫声]

06:46.301 --> 06:49.025
[yelping and snarling]
[尖叫和咆哮]

06:49.094 --> 06:51.025
<i>[dramatic music]</i>
<i>[戏剧音乐]</i>

06:51.094 --> 06:52.439
[screams]
[尖叫声]

06:52.508 --> 06:56.025
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

06:56.094 --> 06:57.370
Whoa!
哇！

06:57.439 --> 06:59.611
Those dudes are huge!
那些家伙太伟大了！

06:59.680 --> 07:01.370
I wonder what they lift!
我想知道他们举起的是什么！

07:01.439 --> 07:02.439
