[尖叫]

07:11.749 --> 07:14.646
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

07:14.715 --> 07:15.818
[crunching and yelling]
[嘎吱嘎吱的声音]

07:15.887 --> 07:18.542
[lighthouse rumbles and creaks]
[灯塔的隆隆声和吱吱声]

07:18.611 --> 07:21.577
[growling]
[咆哮]

07:21.646 --> 07:23.611
[screaming and angry meowing]
[尖叫和愤怒的喵喵声]

07:25.059 --> 07:26.956
[screaming]
[尖叫]

07:27.508 --> 07:29.749
Those buff monsters
have vanished!
那些buff怪物
消失了！

07:29.818 --> 07:31.473
We're saved!
我们得救了！

07:31.542 --> 07:34.542
<i>[dramatic music]</i>
<i>[戏剧音乐]</i>

07:34.611 --> 07:35.956
[screaming and angry meowing]
[尖叫和愤怒的喵喵声]

07:36.197 --> 07:37.059
We're doomed!
我们注定了！

07:37.128 --> 07:38.128
[slurps]
[啜饮]

07:38.163 --> 07:39.094
[screaming]
[尖叫]

07:39.163 --> 07:40.266
[straw slurping]
[吸管的声音]

07:40.335 --> 07:41.335
Oof!
钱币！

07:41.404 --> 07:42.956
[gasps]
[喘气]

07:43.025 --> 07:45.025
My cheeks!
我的脸颊！

07:45.094 --> 07:47.749
<i>[news station theme music]</i>
<i>[新闻台主题音乐]</i>

07:47.818 --> 07:49.301
<i>Can you please tell our viewers</i>
<i>您能告诉我们的观众吗</i>

07:49.370 --> 07:50.956
<i>the cause of this destruction?</i>
<i>造成这种破坏的原因是什么？</i>

07:51.025 --> 07:52.818
<i>It was a lighthouse!</i>
<i>那是一座灯塔！</i>

07:52.887 --> 07:54.128
<i>It rolled through town,</i>
<i>它滚过城镇，</i>

07:54.197 --> 07:55.887
<i>destroying everything in its path!</i>
<i>摧毁其路径上的一切！</i>

07:55.956 --> 07:57.163
<i>[hyperventilates]</i>
<i>[换气过度]</i>

07:57.232 --> 07:59.059
<i>A lighthouse!</i>
<i>灯塔！</i>

07:59.128 --> 08:00.646
<i>[bawls]</i>
<i>[大哭]</i>

08:00.715 --> 08:02.335
<i>My goodness.</i>
<i>天哪。</i>

08:02.404 --> 08:03.439
<i>Were you or</i>
<i>你是</i>

08:03.508 --> 08:04.887
your legs
你的腿

08:04.956 --> 08:07.370
<i>injured by this insane lighthouse?</i>
<i>被这座疯狂的灯塔伤害了？</i>

08:07.439 --> 08:08.680
<i>No.</i>
<i>没有。</i>

08:08.749 --> 08:11.611
<i>[dramatic music]</i>
<i>[戏剧音乐]</i>

08:11.680 --> 08:13.197
[high-pitched scream]
[高声尖叫]

08:13.266 --> 08:16.335
That blasted lighthouse is
gonna demolish me Krusty Krab!
那个被毁的灯塔是
要把我毁掉蟹堡王！

08:16.404 --> 08:18.749
Attention, loyal customers!
忠实顾客请注意！

08:18.818 --> 08:20.370
Run for our lives?
为我们的生命而逃？

08:20.439 --> 08:23.025
No, throw your bodies
in front of that lighthouse
不，扔你的身体
在那座灯塔前面

08:23.094 --> 08:25.439
and protect me restaurant!
并保护我餐厅！

08:25.508 --> 08:26.508
[building rattles]
[建筑嘎嘎声]

08:26.577 --> 08:29.059
[screaming and panic]
[尖叫和恐慌]

08:29.128 --> 08:32.025
[screaming and angry meowing]
[尖叫和愤怒的喵喵声]

08:32.094 --> 08:35.128
No, not the Krusty Krab!
不，不是蟹堡王！

08:35.749 --> 08:37.508
Stay away from me restaurant,
离我远点的餐厅，

08:37.577 --> 08:40.404
you dirty, uh, lighthouse!
你这个肮脏的灯塔！

08:40.473 --> 08:42.508
[screaming and angry meowing]
[尖叫和愤怒的喵喵声]

08:42.577 --> 08:43.991
[high-pitched scream]
[高声尖叫]

08:44.059 --> 08:46.404
Must... stop... lighthouse!
必须...停止...灯塔！

08:46.473 --> 08:47.473
[meows]
[喵喵]

08:48.611 --> 08:49.542
[cries out]
[喊叫]

08:49.611 --> 08:50.542
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

08:50.611 --> 08:53.163
[bones shaking]
[骨头颤抖]

08:53.232 --> 08:54.163
Huh?
啊？

08:54.232 --> 08:55.232
[laughs]
[笑]

08:55.301 --> 08:56.542
And don't come back!
并且不要回来！

08:56.611 --> 08:57.991
[laughs]
[笑]

08:58.059 --> 09:00.439
<i>[dramatic ukulele music]</i>
<i>[戏剧性的尤克里里音乐]</i>

09:00.508 --> 09:05.370
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

09:08.749 --> 09:09.853
[moans]
[呻吟声]

09:09.922 --> 09:13.128
You came back.
你回来了。

09:13.197 --> 09:15.611
[screaming and angry meowing]
[尖叫和愤怒的喵喵声]

09:15.680 --> 09:18.611
<i>[dramatic music]</i>
<i>[戏剧音乐]</i>

09:18.680 --> 09:21.094
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

09:21.680 --> 09:22.577
Ow!
噢！

09:22.646 --> 09:24.197
[heavy metal music plays]
[重金属音乐响起]

09:24.266 --> 09:25.991
[screams]
[尖叫声]

09:26.059 --> 09:28.370
<i>[suspenseful music]</i>
<i>[悬疑音乐]</i>

09:28.439 --> 09:29.335
[wheels squeaking]
[车轮吱吱作响]

09:29.404 --> 09:33.197
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

09:33.266 --> 09:34.163
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

09:34.232 --> 09:35.370
Louie?
路易？

09:35.439 --> 09:36.542
Where's Louie?
路易在哪儿？

09:36.611 --> 09:37.611
[meows]
[喵喵]

09:37.646 --> 09:38.542
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

09:38.611 --> 09:39.680
[purrs]
[呼噜声]

09:39.749 --> 09:42.577
[happy meowing and purring]
[快乐的喵喵声和呼噜声]

09:42.646 --> 09:45.370
<i>[peaceful music]</i>
<i>[平静的音乐]</i>

09:45.439 --> 09:47.059
Aww, Louie!
哇，路易！

09:47.128 --> 09:49.335
You weren't trying
to stop me from cleaning!
你没有尝试
阻止我打扫卫生！

09:49.404 --> 09:51.818
You were just protecting
your cute little babies.
你只是在保护
你们可爱的小宝贝们。

09:51.887 --> 09:53.163
together: [meows]
一起：[喵]

09:53.232 --> 09:55.404
I guess I should call you
Louise instead.
我想我应该给你打电话
取而代之的是路易丝。

09:55.473 --> 09:56.646
[laughs]
[笑]

09:57.577 --> 09:58.715
<i>[upbeat music]</i>
<i>[欢快的音乐]</i>

09:58.784 --> 09:59.956
[gasps]
[喘气]

10:00.025 --> 10:04.301
You actually did a good job,
SpongeBob!
其实你已经做得很好了
海绵宝宝！

10:04.370 --> 10:06.680
You deserve a gold star!
你值得一颗金星！

10:06.749 --> 10:09.059
[squeals]
Gold star!
[尖叫声]
金星！

10:09.128 --> 10:11.749
I have a present for you too,
Mrs. Puff!
我也给你准备了一份礼物
泡芙太太！

10:11.818 --> 10:14.094
[purring and meowing]
[咕噜声和喵喵声]

10:14.163 --> 10:16.001
And these little cuties were
hiding in your lighthouse.
这些小可爱们是
躲在你的灯塔里。

10:16.025 --> 10:17.404
Oh![laughs]
哦！[笑]

10:17.473 --> 10:19.749
Aren't you adorable!
你不是很可爱吗！

10:19.818 --> 10:22.370
Oh, Mrs. Puff.
You're pretty cute, too.
哦，帕夫夫人。
你也很可爱啊

10:22.439 --> 10:23.473
[groans]
[呻吟]

10:23.542 --> 10:26.439
See you next week,
Mrs. Puff!
下周见，
泡芙太太！

10:26.508 --> 10:27.611
Amazing.
惊人的。

10:27.680 --> 10:28.887
For once,
这一次，

10:28.956 --> 10:31.991
SpongeBob didn't create
a huge disaster!
海绵宝宝不是创造的
一场巨大的灾难！

10:32.059 --> 10:33.301
Puff!
噗！

10:33.370 --> 10:36.680
Your blasted lighthouse
destroyed the whole town!
你那该死的灯塔
摧毁了整个城镇！

10:36.749 --> 10:39.266
And me restaurant!
还有我的餐厅！

10:39.335 --> 10:41.094
My lighthouse?
我的灯塔？

10:41.163 --> 10:43.646
all: What are you
gonna do about it?
全体：你是什么
会做些什么吗？

10:43.715 --> 10:46.680
[crowd grumbles]
[人群抱怨]

10:46.749 --> 10:49.266
[heavy metal music plays]
[重金属音乐响起]

10:49.335 --> 10:51.473
Talk to the fin!
和鳍说话！

和鳍说话！